    "title": "Proposed motorcycle training facility in Anderson River Park up for public input - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kelli Saam ,\n13 hours ago ANDERSON, Calif. - The City of Anderson and Hawk Mazzotta Motorcycle Camp are in the early stages of a possible motorcycle training facility at Anderson River Park. A public input meeting is set for Wednesday at 5:30 p.m. at the end of Dodson Lane in Anderson River Park at the remote control plane airstrip. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
